  "releaseNotes": "Loam 3.16.0: Loam.Pickers ColorPicker editable hex entry — set Editable to type/paste a hex color (#RRGGBB, or #AARRGGBB with ShowAlpha) into the field; committed on Enter/blur, parsed via Avalonia's color parser (InvalidHexText on failure; empty reverts). The swatch (or Alt+Down) opens the palette and the flyout stays in sync. Public static TryParseColor exposes the rule. Brings editable entry to all four field pickers. Additive, off by default. See https://araxis.github.io/loam/guide/changelog",
